{"id":1030404,"chapter_id":1030404,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"理发店内，阳光透过巨大的落地玻璃窗照了进来。多塞街调查后，阿黛拉的能力被你用枷锁抑制，袭击事件数量骤减。但你知道，事情还没有结束。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"这就是您所说的“惊喜”吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"你之前说过，觉得在MBCC待得太久了。按照规定我固然不能放你走，但给你一个假期还是可以的。","style":2,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"谢谢，你愿意帮我，我已经很开心了。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"不知为何，即使理发店开在繁华的新城步行街，也依旧没有什么客人。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"阿黛拉并没有觉得失望，而是一遍遍擦拭着桌子。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"options":["抱歉，我该提前做些宣传的。"],"style":6,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404007,"trial_step":7,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"抱歉，我该提前做些宣传的。","goto":8}]},{"step":8,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"没关系。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"你有些局促。眼见有人推门而入，赶紧快步走上前去。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"欢迎光临。本店开业酬宾，理发八折……","style":2,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"来人是一位中年妇人。虽然头发略有些杂乱，岁月亦在她的脸上留下了痕迹，却无法完全掩盖她曾经姣好的面貌。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"她手里拿着一张“开业免费理发券”，茫然局促地看着你。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"你知道，你等的人终于来了。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"是客人吗？来吧，请坐在这边。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"你转过身，阿黛拉的面色很平静。但你知道她已经认出了面前的女人——那是她的母亲，她不可能不记得。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"哦哦，好。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"阿黛拉走到你的身边，深深地看了你一眼。你耸了耸肩。半晌，她有些无可奈何地叹了口气。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"还真是走运，能拿到这么好的理发店的体验券。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"阿黛拉在一边准备工具，凯莉凑了过来，压低声音，神色俏皮得仿佛不是快五十岁的人。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"我一看她就觉得亲切，一定是个好姑娘。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"运气不错啊，能骗到这么漂亮能干的姑娘。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"你颇为尴尬地摆摆手，想要解释你们之间的关系。但此时阿黛拉已经结束了准备，来到凯莉跟前。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"阿黛拉没有说什么，只是默默地取出了剪刀。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"若是在平日，以凯莉的性格，一定会埋怨这位理发师连问都不问一嘴就动手，未免太不尊重人了。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"可今天，望着镜子里的女孩，她只感到莫名的熟悉和安心，默默感受着女孩的手指轻柔地掠过自己的发梢。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"过了一会儿，或许是觉得气氛太过安静了，凯莉终于还是忍不住开口了。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"你知道吗，我以前认识一个女孩，她也想成为一个理发师。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"阿黛拉的动作微微停滞，看了眼镜子里的妇人，笑着点了点头，表示自己在听，手上的工作却没有停止。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"我当时还觉得奇怪呢，理发师有什么可当的。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"今天我才知道，好的理发师真的不一样。只是剪剪头发，就感觉烦恼都不见了。我当初真的是误会她了。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"options":["您有什么烦恼吗？"],"style":6,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404031,"trial_step":31,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"您有什么烦恼吗？","goto":32}]},{"step":32,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"烦恼……也谈不上吧。就是托儿所里的小鬼们实在是不省心……","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"天天给他们洗尿布，天不亮就得起来。又不听话，跑来跑去跟猴子似的。真的是，烦得要命。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"你别看我现在这样，以前可是新城芭蕾舞团工作的，也算是见过世面的。就算是后来离开了舞团，那也是被男人们众星拱月似地围绕着，没受过这种委屈。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"有时候也不知道自己当初是怎么想的，非得找这么份工作，来伺候这群小祖宗，真是头痛死了。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"凯莉有一句没一句地抱怨着，却没见她的表情有说的那么嫌弃。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"阿黛拉继续着她的工作，一缕缕头发缓缓飘落。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"options":["那您知道疯剪子吗？"],"style":6,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404038,"trial_step":38,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"那您知道疯剪子吗？","goto":39}]},{"step":39,"content":"被你冷不丁的一问，凯莉有些茫然地回答：","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"疯剪子？那是谁？","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"与凯莉一同被问住的还有阿黛拉。她有些紧张地捏紧了剪刀，连手上的活计也不禁慢了下来。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"目睹阿黛拉的反应，你莫名觉得有些好笑，于是更进一步地向凯莉解释：","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"新城有名的都市传说。据说她能剪断人的烦恼，让人忘记不想面对的记忆。","style":2,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"要是您对自己现在的生活这么厌烦的话，不妨去找找看疯剪子吧，她说不定会帮您的。","style":2,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"content":"凯莉愣了一下，有些不好意思地笑了。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"还是算了……","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"抱怨归抱怨……我其实还挺喜欢那群小猴子的。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"就好像……就好像，唉，就好像我也曾经有过一个孩子……感觉，挺奇怪的。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"但我这样的人，一定是个糟糕透顶的妈妈，又怎么配有孩子呢？","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"content":"凯莉的语气变得有些消沉。另一边，阿黛拉结束了手中的动作。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"明明发型没有太大变化，只是略作修型，将杂乱开叉的发梢剪去而已。可镜中的凯莉却仿佛年轻了好几岁，变得靓丽非凡。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"凯莉看着镜子，抚摸着自己的头发，不知怎地，眼角竟渗出了些许泪水。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"不满意吗，客人？","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"不……不……太满意了，就好像这头发就应该是这样的……","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"那个女孩也会给我剪一样的发型，这么多年了，我都不舍得换……奇怪……应该是很熟悉的人才对，我怎么突然就想不起她的名字了……","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"凯莉有些失声。意识到自己失态，她又赶忙道起歉来。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"对不起……人上了年纪就喜欢说些有的没的。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"content":"凯莉抹了抹眼角的泪水，有些局促地说道：","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"以前就有人说我，嘴把不住门，想到什么就说什么。我明明有在改了。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"今天不知怎么回事就忍不住，在你们跟前说了这么多没用的废话……","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"不用这么想。您能说这些，我很高兴。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"毕竟，理发师的责任，也包括倾听客人的烦恼。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"……谢谢你，谢谢……","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"凯莉缓缓站起身，向门口走去。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"感谢您的惠顾。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"content":"凯莉转过头。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"凯莉","content":"你……谢谢，剪得很好。我会再来的。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"阿黛拉微笑着点点头。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"期待您再次光临。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"content":"阿黛拉目送着凯莉渐渐走远。直到她在视线中消失，才缓缓转了过来。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"content":"看着阿黛拉的眼神，你感觉有些心虚。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"options":["抱歉，我该提前跟你打个招呼的。"],"style":6,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404072,"trial_step":72,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"抱歉，我该提前跟你打个招呼的。","goto":73}]},{"step":73,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"不用道歉，局长。我该感谢您才是。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"我只是做我应该做的……","style":2,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"虽然您总是自顾自地闯入别人的生活，自顾自地替别人做决定，自顾自地使用枷锁的力量……","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"因为您，我再也不能轻易消除烦恼，只能面对自己内心的空洞，甚至不得不重新面对曾经抛下的过去。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"您让我感到很狼狈，${PlayerName}先生。","female_content":"您让我感到很狼狈，${PlayerName}小姐。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_36","vo_trial_30404_1_36f"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"content":"面对阿黛拉一系列的诘问，你不知该如何回答。","style":3,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"content":"抱歉……","style":2,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"我总能看到别人的发丝生长，变成沉甸甸的累赘，而且他们看上去也总是希望扔掉那些东西……直到你出现，你说那是你无法扔掉的重要之物。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"一开始我并不能明白……为什么你拒绝那份剪掉烦恼的宁静，甚至不惜让自己受伤，也要拼命追上我，将我逮捕。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"甚至之后还对我的过去穷追不舍，让我不得不直面自己真正的烦恼。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_type":1,"src_id":130404082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"我确实一直在逃向新的生活，却没想到自己把最重要的东西遗忘在了过去。","voice":["vo_trial_30404_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":2076,"log_